    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Nicotine replace (gum, lozenge, patch, nasal spray) = designed to reduce w.draw; the US nicotine inhaler was discontinued in 2023."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Combining the patch w a shorter-acting form = more effective than one product and comparable to varenicline; dose about 1 mg of nicotine replace per cigarette smoked a day."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Varenicline = a partial agonist/antagonist @ the alpha-4 beta-2 nicotinic-r; it eases w.draw and blunts the reward of a lapse, and = the most effective monotx."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
